# Discord Bot Configuration
DISCORD_TOKEN=your_bot_token_here
CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to ".env"
# 2. Replace "your_bot_token_here" with your actual bot token from Discord Developer Portal
# 3. Replace "your_client_id_here" with your bot's client ID
# 4. Make sure your bot has the following permissions:
#    - Send Messages
#    - Connect to voice channels
#    - Speak in voice channels
#    - Use Voice Activity 